{
    "word": "thunderous",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7426373e-43b5-3e80-85c1-f88b6270ab84",
                "word": "thunderous",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b485fd5f-288e-48f5-bf68-0262505f4ff0",
                        "entry_id": "7426373e-43b5-3e80-85c1-f88b6270ab84",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more thunderous"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "023fba96-2b91-45d5-bd3b-97c225321318",
                        "entry_id": "7426373e-43b5-3e80-85c1-f88b6270ab84",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most thunderous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                        "entry_id": "7426373e-43b5-3e80-85c1-f88b6270ab84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Very loud; that sounds like thunder; thundersome. Also in metaphorical expressions, signifying fury."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1c52ad0-f59f-4ae8-a5a7-be8396c31f07",
                                "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                                "text": "But when the moon rose and the breeze awakened, and the sedges stirred, and the cat's-paws raced across the moonlit ponds, and the far surf off Wonder Head intoned the hymn of the four winds, the trinity, earth and sky and water, became one thunderous symphony—a harmony of sound and colour silvered to a monochrome by the moon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "208bda31-65db-4bb2-930d-05d0e5249b49",
                                "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                                "text": "He inflated his chest, twirled his moustache, and thumped the table with a revulsion to thunderous indignation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a32cacb-5fc2-4824-8c8b-a64cbc5f3ffe",
                                "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                                "text": "Mr Quelch, with a thunderous brow, marched on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4df8e48-aa63-4496-b87d-d9513405768f",
                                "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                                "text": "I remember the sudden drop in the note of the station bell, as we roar through, perhaps with 16 coaches; sweep up to milepost 9½, and then, with increasing thunder from the exhaust, fairly rush the fells at Milnthorpe at the foot of the climb to Grayrigg, until the steady thunderous beat re-echoes past Mosedale Hall, still at 40 m.p.h."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a588fb6-bd22-434c-977c-3364e193bd74",
                                "sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                                "text": "After the hour mark, events in Manchester were almost becoming a distraction such was the thunderous cheer from the United fans to greet QPR taking their unlikely lead against City."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d900894-0f7e-4fc0-a568-38b4644068fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "7426373e-43b5-3e80-85c1-f88b6270ab84",
                        "source_sense_id": "2e9154fc-4355-3534-82c4-6c3f42125e8c",
                        "source_sense_description": "very loud; suggestive of thunder",
                        "target_lang_word": "tonitruant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tonitruant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fdc0d75-51ce-3823-8b59-7a0faa2f6d27",
                                        "entry_id": "e48f1ee4-83af-3878-8b94-c2fb87a0f7b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui fait un bruit comparable à celui du tonnerre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0b226bf-cf9a-4e93-9568-8ff0b2c91004",
                                                "sense_id": "4fdc0d75-51ce-3823-8b59-7a0faa2f6d27",
                                                "text": "Le Carcan rentrait des champs ; il fut mis au courant de l’affaire et bientôt mêla son organe tonitruant aux glapissements de sa conjointe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6dc6453-2f12-4c08-8285-06967a1ad529",
                                                "sense_id": "4fdc0d75-51ce-3823-8b59-7a0faa2f6d27",
                                                "text": "Le châssis grinça encore, puis, dans un crissement horripilant, le levier joua et la roue trembla et retomba dans l'eau dans un fracas tonitruant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53962a10-d0d4-3104-a460-8b87817c9f53",
                                        "entry_id": "e48f1ee4-83af-3878-8b94-c2fb87a0f7b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui occasionne un bruit retentissant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966b90e1-677a-47c2-8491-415e47a2cfbe",
                                                "sense_id": "53962a10-d0d4-3104-a460-8b87817c9f53",
                                                "text": "À la vue d'Alger, de l'aéroport Houari Boumédiene, je me décontracte, le voyageur devant aussi, avec un lâcher de pets tonitruants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba68fd5e-ca96-473b-baa1-4a62c2af8056",
                                                "sense_id": "53962a10-d0d4-3104-a460-8b87817c9f53",
                                                "text": "L’écrivain considère que les parents d’aujourd’hui “n’aiment plus être autoritaires” et que cette attitude a tendance à rendre les enfants “abjects, tonitruants, malpolis et surtout tyranniques”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29565198-61cc-370d-b91b-62e8d1790c2c",
                                        "entry_id": "e48f1ee4-83af-3878-8b94-c2fb87a0f7b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dont la voix ou les propos sont retentissants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "559e3368-86b8-4298-a527-5d2ed4c76608",
                                                "sense_id": "29565198-61cc-370d-b91b-62e8d1790c2c",
                                                "text": "Au nom de la bien-pensance, des groupes et des partis politiques instillent des interdits qui chamboulent notre démocratie alors que la voix des minorités devient plus tonitruante que celle de la majorité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7049b52-c5cc-44ac-8f77-cda38cc04ab6",
                                                "sense_id": "29565198-61cc-370d-b91b-62e8d1790c2c",
                                                "text": "Du 9 au 12 janvier, une semaine avant de vider les lieux, il a multiplié les annonces tonitruantes, voire provocatrices, concernant l’Iran, la guerre au Yémen, les relations avec Cuba ou encore avec Taïwan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tonitruant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b4fd0bb-f5e5-39ce-8e0f-07c1c43c6ae6",
                                        "entry_id": "6c667be4-dd6b-352f-9158-7281eceb6da7",
